50/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTM0MjQx/NDMtMTQyNDA5ODUx/Ny04NTM2LmpwZWc.jpeg","profile":"Clap! Clap! is a the project by Italian producer Cristiano Crisci, focused on research and sampling of tribes, bands and singers originating from the African continent. Its strong personality is characterised by the work on the used samples, extremely eclectic and as percussive as possible.\r\n\r\nHis distinguishing technique is to reproduce classic African rhythms in a contemporary way, through the use of drum machines and synths. The keywords of this experience are ‘future roots’ and ‘future rhythm.’ Clap! Clap! is trying to convey a continuous dance that is febrile, tribal and hyper-kinetic, but always balanced by the elegance and the essentiality of the elements used.","provider":"discogs","ref":"discogs:artist:3424143","relations":{"aliases":[{"id":1489841,"name":"Digi G'Alessio"},{"id":4260118,"name":"Cristiano Crisci"},{"id":5090227,"name":"Beats By Clap! Clap!"},{"id":5172642,"name":"Troubled Minds Cabin Crew"}],"groups":null,"members":null,"namevariations":["Clap ! Clap !","Clap Clap","Clap!Clap!"]},"schemaVersion":2,"sourceUrl":"https://www.discogs.com/artist/3424143-Clap!-Clap!","type":"artist","urls":["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Clap!_Clap!","http://www.facebook.com/clakclakboomclak","http://soundcloud.com/clakclakboomclak","https://clapclap.bandcamp.com/"]}},"/api/discogs/artist/37606/profile":{"cached":true,"profile":{"id":"37606","image":"https://i.discogs.com/fLTDZp77R4njfqmYh0w_e6pTu1Ar0No8Q8ItRZ7mUGE/rs:fit/g:sm/q:90/h:600/w:483/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTM3NjA2/LTEzOTk3MTkzMzIt/MjI5OC5qcGVn.jpeg","imageThumb":"https://i.discogs.com/j37roVF2GSjle2NLd1mBsR4QN41KPSq76b6yoWJv2TY/rs:fit/g:sm/q:40/h:150/w:150/czM6Ly9kaXNjb2dz/LWRhdGFiYXNlLWlt/YWdlcy9BLTM3NjA2/LTEzOTk3MTkzMzIt/MjI5OC5qcGVn.jpeg","profile":"British singer-songwriter born in London on July 21, 1948. His musical career was interrupted in 1969 when he contracted t